    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark and mysterious lands of the Middle Ages, this action role-playing game invites players into an epic adventure where the destructive power of magic and the sharp edge of steel collide. Whether you evolve your character as a battle mage or a close-combat warrior, fight your enemies in your own unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The open world, crafted with realistic graphics, is filled with dangers and secrets waiting to be uncovered. In this freely explorable realm, players can gather resources to forge their own armor and gear, shaping the gameplay according to their personal preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply woven storyline is brought to life through cinematic storytelling. The character\u2019s past, the tragedy of their family, and the secrets behind the magic gradually unfold as the game progresses. The choices you make in dialogues affect not only your fate, but the course of the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With immersive quest chains, a variety of enemy types, and combat mechanics that require diverse strategies, the game emphasizes both action and tactical thinking. Every enemy is a challenge, and every piece of armor is a tale of triumph.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape your destiny, write your legend.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/fbde5e65d135c4dd8ebcc6d64c2ddc59.poster.avif?t=1753433700\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/fbde5e65d135c4dd8ebcc6d64c2ddc59.webm?t=1753433700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/fbde5e65d135c4dd8ebcc6d64c2ddc59.mp4?t=1753433700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each step is the gateway to a whole new world.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/c665d38ff1066148fd6078f9e3b96935.poster.avif?t=1753433700\" width=540 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/c665d38ff1066148fd6078f9e3b96935.webm?t=1753433700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/c665d38ff1066148fd6078f9e3b96935.mp4?t=1753433700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The paths are clear, your horse is ready. It\u2019s time to explore.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the wind tousles your hair and your steed gallops forward, you stand at the edge of boundless discovery. In every valley lies a secret, in every path a surprise. This world is for the brave. Ride on\u2014there will be no need to look back when what's ahead is this unforgettable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/3c97766d442b113188ace3b08df5ccbd.poster.avif?t=1753433700\" width=540 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/3c97766d442b113188ace3b08df5ccbd.webm?t=1753433700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/3c97766d442b113188ace3b08df5ccbd.mp4?t=1753433700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkness belongs not to the fearful, but to the seekers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only silence... and the sound of drops coming from afar. Every step echoes off the stone walls. The darkness of the cave seems to try to swallow you, but you don\u2019t falter. Because behind every darkness, there is a secret. Maybe an ancient spell, maybe a forgotten power... Or perhaps, it\u2019s just a moment to face your fears. Gather your courage. The darkness is here to test you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is not a stagnant world, but a vibrant one</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is not just about stone buildings or markets. In these streets, laughter rises, whispers echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/d6eab12926c84e54051d60e8bc7495c5.poster.avif?t=1753433700\" width=544 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/d6eab12926c84e54051d60e8bc7495c5.webm?t=1753433700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564650/extras/d6eab12926c84e54051d60e8bc7495c5.mp4?t=1753433700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
